        "Yellowing around spots",
        "Can affect stems and fruits"
      ],
      "causes": "Fungal infection spread by wind and rain",
      "favorable_conditions": {
        "temperature": "20-25°C",
        "humidity": "High humidity",
        "season": "Warm, humid weather"
      },
      "treatment": {
        "organic": "Copper-based fungicides, neem oil spray, remove affected leaves",
        "chemical": "Chlorothalonil, mancozeb, or copper hydroxide applications",
        "preventive": "Crop rotation, resistant varieties, proper spacing, avoid overhead watering"
      }
    },
